Why: the WindowServer diagnostic recognizes Brigadier's helper bundles (Brigadier Computer Use.app and BrigadierCu.app) and BRIGADIER_CU_EMBEDDED=1, and uses the helper's own launch setup instead of recommending the upstream app daemon.

Only this diagnostic reads the host identity; embedded launch and permission
behavior elsewhere is unchanged. Includes failing-before bundle and embedded
regressions, plus coverage of the remediation hint and observed 1002 failures.

